text:
if you're ever stuck like I was, call this guy charles,
I call him a genius!

thanks for showing up as promised fast work for a fair emergency price!

Wow, all I can say is that we have found our mechanic!!!!!  Seriously, if you're looking for an honest, trustworthy mechanic with the lowest prices in town, then I highly recommend Akin's Auto Repair!!  What a life saver! 

   We went to Sear's for our car and in addition to not being able to fix the problem, they said that they had to fix another problem before they could attempt to fix the original problem we had taken the car there for in the first place.  This is after dealing with them for two days and taking unnecessary time off of work. We called Akin's Auto Repair the same day and they said to bring it in to the shop in the morning.  Not only did they make time and fix the problem without charging us a ridiculous amount of money or having to fix anything else, but they did it all in the same day!!!!  AND it was cheaper than Sear's!!  They really took the time and went over and beyond what any other mechanic had ever done for us.The customer service is just amazing there at Akin's.  The facility is so clean and they really do their best as fast as they can and at the best prices.  

If you don't have a regular mechanic that you can trust, look no further!!!!!  Go to Akin's and spread the word about their great service.  Great people should get great business. We are happy campers!! Thank you Akin's!!! :}
